  "prefLabel": "Plc 1406.01 Licensee Obligations to Notify",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1406.01 Licensee Obligations to Notify. Each licensee shall comply with Plc 307.02 relative to required notifications, updates of contact information, and providing information on how complaints can be filed.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1400) #13705, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14442, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES 1-26-36",
